17
00:00:36.067 --> 00:00:38.307
heiress. Her husband

18
00:00:38.307 --> 00:00:39.727
traditionally lives in his

19
00:00:39.727 --> 00:00:41.657
mother in law's house.

20
00:00:41.657 --> 00:00:43.627
A family tree where the youngest

21
00:00:43.627 --> 00:00:45.377
