34
00:01:10.076 --> 00:01:11.976
Kerala's Joint Family System

35
00:01:11.976 --> 00:01:13.956
Abolition Act, nineteen seventy

36
00:01:13.956 --> 00:01:17.336
five, ended the Marumakkathayam

37
00:01:17.336 --> 00:01:18.166
system.

38
